{"data": [{"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113670788226146745"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Scientists tracked the changing sleep patterns of Indigenous people in Argentina who gained access to mains electricity — and smart phones.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4yCFTv8", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4yCFTv8", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113670793431257088/Q82Wk6OD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113670793431257088/Q82Wk6OD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 140, "status": 200, "title": "Sleep declines in rural communities after electricity arrives", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03318-2?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64213437&error=cookies_not_supported&code=8a50b14b-cc86-4d09-832d-124c7efd6424", "url": "https://t.co/GJtIKVaJ3d"}]}, "id": "2113670788226146745", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 6416, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Scientists tracked the changing sleep patterns of Indigenous people in Argentina who gained access to mains electricity — and smart phones\n\nhttps://t.co/GJtIKVaJ3d", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113670788226146745"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113670368325931008"]}, "author_id": "407985006", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:34:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113670371115171986"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Lab experiments provide new details about the charge-transfer process that occurs in ash clouds and other collections of particles.", "display_url": "go.aps.org/4kery4l", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://go.aps.org/4kery4l", "images": [{"height": 250, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113670376131534849/pe4La2Tp?format=png&name=orig", "width": 500}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113670376131534849/pe4La2Tp?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 251, "status": 200, "title": "Tiny Particles Charge Like Capacitors", "unwound_url": "https://physics.aps.org/articles/v19/143", "url": "https://t.co/IXSVSBa0Vb"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/V6NxmbcSoz", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/PhysicsMagazine/status/2113670371115171986/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113670368325931008", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/V6NxmbcSoz"}]}, "id": "2113670371115171986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 517, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "By measuring repeated collisions between a pair of levitated particles, researchers found that triboelectric charging follows a universal pattern over longer times — insights that could improve models of charging in real-world phenomena. \n\nRead more: https://t.co/IXSVSBa0Vb https://t.co/V6NxmbcSoz", "url": "https://x.com/PhysicsMagazine/status/2113670371115171986"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113669331632451584"]}, "author_id": "14499829", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:30:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113669334757159030"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MrcusyIDW1", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2113669334757159030/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113669331632451584", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/MrcusyIDW1"}]}, "id": "2113669334757159030", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 21908, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "When extreme heat strikes, how many people become ill or die? \n \nToo often, the true toll remains invisible.\n \nA new global monitoring framework will help countries connect health and heat-exposure data—to support earlier action to protect pregnant women, newborns and children. https://t.co/MrcusyIDW1", "url": "https://x.com/WHO/status/2113669334757159030"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:27:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113668756589228129"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "As a Boston judge heard a challenge to Medicaid work requirements, state Medicaid directors gathered in Maryland to figure out how to implement those sweeping changes.", "display_url": "trib.al/JXtlzpG", "end": 191, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/JXtlzpG", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113668765585899521/BY2iELPd?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113668765585899521/BY2iELPd?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 168, "status": 200, "title": "Anxiety builds over Medicaid work requirements", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/medicaid-work-requirements-anxiety-morning-rounds-health-news/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/O5e87fAAUr"}]}, "id": "2113668756589228129", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1197, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "As a Boston judge heard a challenge to Medicaid work requirements, state Medicaid directors gathered in Maryland to figure out how to implement those sweeping changes. https://t.co/O5e87fAAUr", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2113668756589228129"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113663840647045120"]}, "author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:16:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113665928923869395"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uLVvkL1x5g", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113665928923869395/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113663840647045120", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/uLVvkL1x5g"}]}, "id": "2113665928923869395", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 38, "impression_count": 11735, "like_count": 105, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "Bone as a modulator of aging.\nDynamic force on the tibia is sensed and extends healthspan and lifespan, with reduced inflammation,  and bone marrow immunosenescence in the experimental model.  When Piezo1 (pressure sensor) receptor was deleted, resulting in lack of sensing, the https://t.co/uLVvkL1x5g", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113665928923869395"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113664748893954410"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Infectious-disease researchers say the risk of the virus moving between people is low.", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4dWWzGe", "end": 114, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4dWWzGe", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113664754564653056/AOun2OmY?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113664754564653056/AOun2OmY?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 91, "status": 200, "title": "First human infected with rare livestock pathogen: what we know about Shamonda virus", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03416-1?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64213426&error=cookies_not_supported&code=4c96014c-2f88-4503-96e2-e3ed6c3407cb", "url": "https://t.co/qtPDsUAx7T"}]}, "id": "2113664748893954410", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 10744, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "A cancer patient in France has become the first human known to contract the Shamonda virus\nhttps://t.co/qtPDsUAx7T", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113664748893954410"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113662573019283456"]}, "author_id": "26832834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T16:03:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113662575204561102"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/KMxP4nnkqa", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113662575204561102/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113662573019283456", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/KMxP4nnkqa"}]}, "id": "2113662575204561102", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1335, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "CAR-T therapies are generating excitement beyond cancer, with trials in autoimmune disease. But recent results have complicated that picture.\n\nIn our latest news story, Marianne Guenot asks what the latest developments mean for the field. Read more: dlvr.​it/TW2LG7 https://t.co/KMxP4nnkqa", "url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113662575204561102"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113661035232346112"]}, "author_id": "26832834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:57:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113661040009633842"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ULwlQXc6DG", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113661040009633842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113661035232346112", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/ULwlQXc6DG"}]}, "id": "2113661040009633842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1393, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A high-profile chronotherapy trial was retracted. What does the fallout mean for a field built around the idea that when we treat disease can matter?\n\nNatalie Healey investigates what comes next for chronotherapy in NatureMedicine.\nRead more: dlvr.​it/TW2KzW https://t.co/ULwlQXc6DG", "url": "https://x.com/NatureMedicine/status/2113661040009633842"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:43:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113657449479631075"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - The use of artificial-intelligence tools in medicine is increasing. What types of technology might be on the horizon and how can such health-advice tools be tested?", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4dTvPq3", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4dTvPq3", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113657454147821568/0Wv70l6z?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113657454147821568/0Wv70l6z?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 145, "status": 200, "title": "Using AI to offer personalized health advice", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03065-4?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64201509&error=cookies_not_supported&code=0447f2b8-d821-4983-bd25-110815e96de3", "url": "https://t.co/AKlOOfE8g9"}]}, "id": "2113657449479631075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 6793, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The use of AI tools in medicine is increasing. What types of technology might be on the horizon and how can such health-advice tools be tested?\n\nhttps://t.co/AKlOOfE8g9", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113657449479631075"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:32:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113654837548093457"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "As the ESMO conference kicks off, Tango's pancreatic cancer combination shows striking promise and detailed data on Moderna and Merck's cancer vaccine is released early.", "display_url": "trib.al/qlBavCG", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/qlBavCG", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113654844342816768/MI3iVLYE?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113654844342816768/MI3iVLYE?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 170, "status": 200, "title": "Tango builds on Revolution Medicines' pancreatic cancer success", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/tango-pancreatic-cancer-star-moderna-readout-newsletter/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/hUrAUPaQYE"}]}, "id": "2113654837548093457", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1274, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "As the ESMO conference kicks off, Tango's pancreatic cancer combination shows striking promise and detailed data on Moderna and Merck's cancer vaccine is released early. https://t.co/hUrAUPaQYE", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2113654837548093457"}, {"author_id": "15862891", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:08:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113648854809649633"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - What can a researcher in an overworked laboratory do to take care of themselves and their lab-mates, and how should they navigate medical disclosure?", "display_url": "go.nature.com/4yCFfhc", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://go.nature.com/4yCFfhc", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648859381411840/BrIS3Oqm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648859381411840/BrIS3Oqm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 151, "status": 200, "title": "I’m expected to work excessive hours in the lab. Should I speak up about my disability?", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02582-6?utm_source=x&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=nature&linkId=64213387&error=cookies_not_supported&code=c5eed9de-dd91-4bbf-8e5f-183b091b2776", "url": "https://t.co/S15oJDceTq"}]}, "id": "2113648854809649633", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 12704, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "What can a researcher in an overworked laboratory do to take care of themselves and their lab-mates, and how should they navigate medical disclosure?\n\nhttps://t.co/S15oJDceTq", "url": "https://x.com/Nature/status/2113648854809649633"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113648115362463744"]}, "author_id": "86626845", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:06:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113648289639960836"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 104, "id": "27013292", "start": 94, "username": "TheLancet"}], "urls": [{"description": "Having immersed myself in death and dying for well over a decade—I wrote a book, The Way We Die Now (2016), and was later a member of the Lancet Commission on The Value of Death—it was inevitable that I would become interested in the flip side of that subject: the world of longevity. I use the word “world” because it has so many constituent parts: science, industry, economics, medicine, philosophy, religion, and politics.", "display_url": "thelancet.com/journals/lance…", "end": 129, "expanded_url": "https://www.thelancet.com/journals/lancet/article/PIIS0140-6736(26)02112-4/fulltext", "images": [{"height": 300, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648295172329473/StibTCrr?format=png&name=orig", "width": 300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113648295172329473/StibTCrr?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 106, "status": 200, "title": "Longevity is a political concern", "unwound_url": "https://www.thelancet.com/journals/lancet/article/PIIS0140-6736(26)02112-4/abstract", "url": "https://t.co/fOIMW9qxeX"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/l7L4drjYKY", "end": 153, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113648289639960836/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113648115362463744", "start": 130, "url": "https://t.co/l7L4drjYKY"}]}, "id": "2113648289639960836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 73, "impression_count": 19188, "like_count": 220, "quote_count": 19, "reply_count": 42, "retweet_count": 42}, "text": "\"The longevity industry is a goldrush without gold.\"\nand other strong words about 2 delusions @TheLancet \nhttps://t.co/fOIMW9qxeX https://t.co/l7L4drjYKY", "url": "https://x.com/EricTopol/status/2113648289639960836"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113646749390606336"]}, "author_id": "32372834", "created_at": "2026-10-23T15:00:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646751529701866"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 27, "start": 15, "tag": "optogenetic"}], "mentions": [{"end": 242, "id": "137777298", "start": 232, "username": "scisignal"}], "urls": [{"description": "Optogenetically coupling GIRK channel activation to an opsin switches G protein signaling.", "display_url": "scim.ag/4eImxxk", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://scim.ag/4eImxxk", "images": [{"height": 550, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112610490480496640/TpmxG7W_?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 715}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2112610490480496640/TpmxG7W_?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Improving optogenetic control over Gi/o-coupled receptor signaling by optimized GIRK channel expression", "unwound_url": "https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/scisignal.adw4374?utm_campaign=ScienceMagazine&utm_medium=ownedSocial&utm_source=twitter", "url": "https://t.co/o23pnsZscd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/AoW5XTbz9U", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2113646751529701866/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113646749390606336", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/AoW5XTbz9U"}]}, "id": "2113646751529701866", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 7827, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "A new slate of #optogenetic tools enables scientists to finely control G protein signaling in excitable cells—providing a flexible method that might also be used therapeutically for disorders that disrupt the excitability of cells. @SciSignal https://t.co/o23pnsZscd https://t.co/AoW5XTbz9U", "url": "https://x.com/ScienceMagazine/status/2113646751529701866"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:58:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113646210653315076"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "The proposal would restrict U.S. investments in Chinese biotechs, but still allows licensing deals.", "display_url": "trib.al/55k3Afy", "end": 145, "expanded_url": "https://trib.al/55k3Afy", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113633301332140032/VuADMW4w?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113633301332140032/VuADMW4w?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 122, "status": 200, "title": "Treasury proposes major restrictions to U.S. investment in Chinese biotech sector", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/new-china-biotech-limits-coins-act-proposal-us-pharma-reaction/?utm_campaign=twitter_organic&utm_source=twitter&utm_medium=social", "url": "https://t.co/npeyC5kKzP"}]}, "id": "2113646210653315076", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1219, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A new Treasury Department proposal would restrict U.S. investments in Chinese biotechs, but still allows licensing deals. https://t.co/npeyC5kKzP", "url": "https://x.com/statnews/status/2113646210653315076"}, {"author_id": "860158302", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:56:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113645760554135986"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "To invade red blood cells, the deadly protists create temporary molecular portals that disappear behind them — doors we can now see in fine detail.", "display_url": "quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasi…", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasite-caught-in-the-act-of-breaking-and-entering-20261023/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113645763972481024/y5u7T7ny?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113645763972481024/y5u7T7ny?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Malaria Parasite Caught in the Act of Breaking and Entering | Quanta Magazine", "unwound_url": "https://www.quantamagazine.org/malaria-parasite-caught-in-the-act-of-breaking-and-entering-20261023/", "url": "https://t.co/JyPSUT29CU"}]}, "id": "2113645760554135986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 3705, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "To invade red blood cells, malaria parasites create a temporary molecular portal that lets it slip into the cell — and then disappears behind it. Researchers have finally detailed the proteins that let it break in without tripping the alarms. https://t.co/JyPSUT29CU", "url": "https://x.com/QuantaMagazine/status/2113645760554135986"}, {"author_id": "3290364847", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:44:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113642671667392816"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "It seems everyone has a hot take on the new Elizabeth Holmes documentary, \"You Can See Everything.\" STAT reporters went to see the film — here's their review.", "display_url": "statnews.com/2026/10/23/exp…", "end": 113, "expanded_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/explain-appeal-elizabeth-holmes-doc-status-report/", "images": [{"height": 576, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113578589996146688/bZ2Vzwbm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113578589996146688/bZ2Vzwbm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 90, "status": 200, "title": "STAT reporters react to the new Elizabeth Holmes documentary", "unwound_url": "https://www.statnews.com/2026/10/23/explain-appeal-elizabeth-holmes-doc-status-report/", "url": "https://t.co/rBJP1vDlUX"}]}, "id": "2113642671667392816", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1222, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "People can't stop talking about '